# The gate also covers a static whose signature names a class the *consumer*
# never declares as a dependency. `@test/uconsumer` uses `Api` as a class but
# none of its statics; `Zu` lives in `@test/ubase`, two hops away and outside
# `@test/uconsumer`'s dependency closure, so reconstructing `Api`'s statics
# there would type them against a class it cannot name.
#
# The consumer has to be a library package: the fixture harness hands the root
# script every package declaration regardless of its manifest deps, so a
# root-only version of this cannot exercise the path at all.
# name          dir       deps            root
@test/ubase     base      -
@test/umid      mid       @test/ubase
@test/uconsumer consumer  @test/umid
main            app       @test/uconsumer  root
